Return a usable filesystem root when the manager handles every mount.
A single committed EROFS layer otherwise produces System=[]; BuildKit exports
an empty layer and the EROFS differ panics indexing mounts[0]. Preserve the
ActivationInfo non-empty System contract and decline genuinely empty diffs.
Rebased onto v2.4.2, which already has the transform bounds guard but still
requires Temporary for the final bind mount and still indexes mounts[0].

